  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo! Ariyeli, Ariyeli, mukala washakaminaŋa Davidi! Nuŋenuku mwaka himwaka, yawija yinzaŋa tuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinakamwesha Ariyeli kukala, kwakekala kudishishimona nakudila, yena kudami wakekala neyi Ariyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukukutuŋaila chilombu kwi-i-ndo, nukukukuchika nampwembu, nakakudimina mpwembu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakushikŋa hamaseki, wakahoshela mumaseki, chiwakahosha chakekala chakuhoshela mwishina chamulunkuŋu; izu deyi dakekala neyi damuntu wazakukaŋa mukishi, chakuhoshela mumaseki, chiwakahosha chakekala neyi chakushawutila mulunkuŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa luntu lwawantu eyi akwacheŋa lwakekala neyi lunkuŋu lwasweja kuleluka, luntu lwawatiyawu woma lwakekala neyi muzuŋu wukuleloka; mwalala yumiyi akayikasumuka yinashi ki dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamuhempula kudi Yehova wamazaza nakudidima, nakukankisha iseki, nalushindu lwalweni, nachinjimbi, ninvula yasweja kuzuwa, nimulaŋu wakesi kadi nakuya nakunoŋesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luntu lwanyuza yejima lukulwa naAriyeli, antu ejima akulwanayena nampwembu yindi, akumumwesha kukala akekala neyi chilota, neyi chuma chakumona nawufuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakekala neyi muntu nafwi nzalahakulota nindi nidi nakudya, ilaŋa hakutona, saŋa adiyi nanzala; indi kwijamu ntu nafwi mpwila, hakulota nindi nidi nakunwa, ilaŋa hakutona, komanasaŋa azeyelayi, saŋa atiyilayi chikahukahu; dichi chakekala luntu lwanyuza yejima yikulwa nampidi yaZiyona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labenu, mudihayamini; tiyenu kuwaha, muputi mesu. Anasheti kwawu, ilaŋa hichavinyuku; adi nakutedaŋila, ilaŋa hichawalwaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta nindi, Ichi chaneluwu antu awa hiyakukundama kwakwihi, hiyakunlemesha natunwa twawu nanyivumbu yawu, kwinza nyichima yawu ayifumisha dehi, ayitwala dehi kwakulehi nanami, niwoma wawu wantiyaloŋa awuhichuma chakuyileja kudi antu nohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu tiyenu, hinukuya nakukoŋa mudimu wakuhayama mukachi kawantu awa, mudimuwakuhayama, chuma chakuhayama hohu; maana awakwawu akwamaana akakisika, kashinshi kawakwawu akwakudihoŋesha mumuchima kakaswamana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo! Antu akuya mwakunama kulonda aswekelumu mpùŋa jawu, nawu, Yehova abuli kujitiya, akweti nyidimu yawu yamumwidima, elaŋa anawu, Anatumoni kudinyi? Anatwiluki kudinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O chimwabalumonaŋa yuma! Komana kapemi amufuukuli nawu hiiwumba? Nichuma chemenewi chimwili wachemeni, nindi haŋemenuku? Nichuma chatuŋiluwu chimwili wachitupili, nindi hakweti kashinshuku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikunashali kapinji kantesha nankashuku? Lebanoni wakabalumuka kwikala ihadasoŋa yakudya, iha dasoŋa yakudya akadifuukula nawuhilusesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu wajika matu wakatiya mazu amukandowu, mesu awamputamesu akamona mukabwidibwidi nimumwidima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ádizoza akasweja kutiya kuwaha naYehova, atuzweŋa ekala mukachi kawantu akazaŋa alalana Wajila waIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa muntu atiyawu woma wakafwomoka, nimukwakadiwu jakamukuma, niantu ejima atalilaŋa kuluwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enkaŋa akwawu nyiloŋa yakalusaŋu kantesha, atilaŋa mukwakufumba akwawumuchota nyihetu, ateŋululaŋa akwakuloŋa nachuma chamukunkulwayi, akayifumishahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chanahoshiyi Yehova wakúulili Abarahama, nateni dehi mutaŋa waYakoba, nindi, Ichi dinu akwaYakoba hiyakatiyansonyuku, hiyakatookoloka nawa kumcsuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa chakamonawu anyanawu, wowu mudimu wakumakasami, adi mukachi kawu, ijina dami akadimonakujila, mwalala kwaamu, Wajila waYakoba akamumona kujila hohu, Nzambi yaIsarela akamwakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluwalala muspiritu jawu akelukakashinshi, atobatobaŋa akadiza yakayilejawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
